Complete 24-Page Manga Storyboard
Version 3.0 — Production Storyboard
(Supplied by the user on 2026-11-12. Reproduced verbatim from the user's message.)

Core message: Welbuk connects the work required before, during, and after patient care, helping healthcare teams coordinate clinical and operational workflows.
Format: 24 portrait pages, four panels per page, English dialogue, left-to-right reading order.

Main characters
* Dr. Ananya: Clinic owner and doctor. White coat over teal clothing, dark hair tied back.
* Meera: Receptionist. Blue outfit, long dark hair, friendly and capable.
* Ravi: Patient in his 30s, usually wearing a pale green shirt.
* Nurse: Existing nurse character sheet.
* Mr. Raman: Elderly patient.
* Priya: Patient appearing in appointment and specialty workflows.
* Pharmacist and laboratory technician: Existing character references.
* Specialists, paediatrician and clinic administrator: Supporting roles; use consistent reference designs.

Release status rules
* LIVE: Documented production capabilities, subject to final release verification.
* STAGING: Functionality developed or being tested, not confirmed as production-ready.
* WORK IN PROGRESS: Product or infrastructure under development, without an availability promise.
* VISION: Future Welbuk healthcare ecosystem.

